This creates an interesting riddle within the riddle: How have Jerusalem's current inhabitants already "come out from fire"? They're still in Jerusalem, not in exile.\
Looking at the vine wood metaphor itself - the text emphasizes the wood is given to fire as its only purpose (verse 4: 
